

I don't know perl, so if you improve this script, commit it or submit it to bryan.

Type these:

/script load /path/to/wraith.pl
/auth

Settings:

/set auth_secpass <your_secpass>
/set auth_authkey <your_authkey>
/set auth_password <password>       (optional - auto-responds to auth./auth!)

Hash algorithm (default sha256, "md5" for old bots):
/set auth_hash_algorithm sha256
/set auth_hash_algorithm md5

The script handles -Auth challenges in both private messages and DCC chat.
SHA256 (64 hex chars) is preferred; the bot still accepts MD5 (32 hex chars).

This has not been tested with psyBNC, but in theory it will work.

